roteins. Inhibits calcium entry by suppressing voltage-dependent calcium channels. Acts as the functionally dominant somatostatin receptor in pancreatic alpha- and beta-cells where it mediates the inhibitory effect of somatostatin-14 on hormone secretion. Inhibits cell growth through enhancement of MAPK1 [...] "},{"po":116156,"n":"tissue::thyroid gland","v":"2.598003","d":"double"},{"po":116156,"n":"display name","v":"SSTR2"},{"po":116156,"n":"tissue::adrenal gland","v":"2.840312","d":"double"},{"po":116156,"n":"tissue::gall bladder","v":"2.495229","d":"double"},{"po":116156,"n":"log2FoldChange","v":"1.286360312068112","d":"double"},{"po":116156,"n":"stringdb::sequence","v":""},{"po":116156,"n":"tissue::intestine","v":"2.863052","d":"double"},{"po":116156,"n":"stringdb::node color","v":"rgb(117,146,239)"},{"po":116156,"n":"stringdb::database identifier","v":"9606.ENSP00000350198"},{"po":116156,"n":"tissue::blood","v":"2.358579","d":"double"},{"po":116156,"n":"tissue::spleen","v":"2.403712","d":"double"},{"po":116153,"n":"padj","v":"4.749521757955029E-6","d":"double"},{"po":116153,"n":"stringdb::namespace","v":"stringdb"},{"po":116153,"n":"compartment::golgi apparatus","v":"0.938641","d":"double"},{"po":116153,"n":"tissue::urine","v":"0.790569","d":"double"},{"po":116153,"n":"compartment::nucleus","v":"4.562078","d":"double"},{"po":116153,"n":"stringdb::structures","v":["AF-P78415"],"d":"list_of_string"},{"po":116153,"n":"tissue::saliva","v":"1.831093","d":"double"},{"po":116153,"n":"stringdb::species","v":"Homo sapiens"},{"po":116153,"n":"compartment::peroxisome","v":"0.795993","d":"double"},{"po":116153,"n":"tissue::liver","v":"1.831712","d":"double"},{"po":116153,"n":"lfcSE","v":"0.3132059555816967","d":"double"},{"po":116153,"n":"compartment::extracellular","v":"1.764232","d":"double"},{"po":116153,"n":"tissue::stomach","v":"1.922479","d":"double"},{"po":116153,"n":"tissue::bone marrow","v":"1.402739","d":"double"},{"po":116153,"n":"compartment::endosome","v":"0.