t reaction to form L-cystathionine, the precursor of L-cysteine. This catabolic route allows the elimination of L-methionine and the toxic metabolite L-homocysteine. Also involved in the production of hydrogen sulfide, a gasotransmitter with signaling and cytoprotective effects on neurons."},{"po":116063,"n":"tissue::thyroid gland","v":"2.49676","d":"double"},{"po":116063,"n":"display name","v":"CBS"},{"po":116063,"n":"tissue::adrenal gland","v":"1.97621","d":"double"},{"po":116063,"n":"tissue::gall bladder","v":"1.489437","d":"double"},{"po":116063,"n":"log2FoldChange","v":"-0.6997147919837557","d":"double"},{"po":116063,"n":"stringdb::sequence","v":""},{"po":116063,"n":"tissue::intestine","v":"2.849772","d":"double"},{"po":116063,"n":"stringdb::node color","v":"rgb(117,117,239)"},{"po":116063,"n":"stringdb::database identifier","v":"9606.ENSP00000381231"},{"po":116063,"n":"tissue::blood","v":"2.992049","d":"double"},{"po":116063,"n":"tissue::spleen","v":"2.463138","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"padj","v":"0.0030089717120779","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"stringdb::namespace","v":"stringdb"},{"po":116057,"n":"compartment::golgi apparatus","v":"1.763824","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"tissue::urine","v":"1.303715","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"compartment::nucleus","v":"3.451913","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"stringdb::structures","v":["AF-Q14123"],"d":"list_of_string"},{"po":116057,"n":"tissue::saliva","v":"0.605283","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"stringdb::species","v":"Homo sapiens"},{"po":116057,"n":"compartment::peroxisome","v":"0.786813","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"tissue::liver","v":"1.616379","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"lfcSE","v":"0.215094168323818","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"compartment::extracellular","v":"1.408875","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"tissue::stomach","v":"1.245517","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"tissue::bone marrow","v":"0.470776","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"compartment::endosome","v":"0.663121","d":"double"},{"po"