:"stringdb:9606.ENSP00000379496"},{"po":116057,"n":"compartment::endoplasmic reticulum","v":"1.373723","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"stringdb::description","v":"Calcium/calmodulin-dependent 3',5'-cyclic nucleotide phosphodiesterase 1C; Calmodulin-dependent cyclic nucleotide phosphodiesterase with a dual-specificity for the second messengers cAMP and cGMP, which are key regulators of many important physiological processes. Has a high affinity for both cAMP and cGMP. Modulates the amplitude and duration of the cAMP signal in sensory cilia in response to odorant stimulation, hence contributing to the generation of action potentials. Regulates smooth muscle cell proliferation. Regulates the stability of growth factor receptors, including PDGFRB (P [...] "},{"po":116057,"n":"tissue::thyroid gland","v":"1.584961","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"display name","v":"PDE1C"},{"po":116057,"n":"tissue::adrenal gland","v":"1.419047","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"tissue::gall bladder","v":"0.605283","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"log2FoldChange","v":"-0.1102827521458714","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"stringdb::sequence","v":""},{"po":116057,"n":"tissue::intestine","v":"1.406239","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"stringdb::node color","v":"rgb(239,135,117)"},{"po":116057,"n":"stringdb::database identifier","v":"9606.ENSP00000379496"},{"po":116057,"n":"tissue::blood","v":"1.661114","d":"double"},{"po":116057,"n":"tissue::spleen","v":"1.217245","d":"double"},{"po":116048,"n":"padj","v":"9.0260492146342E-6","d":"double"},{"po":116048,"n":"stringdb::namespace","v":"stringdb"},{"po":116048,"n":"compartment::golgi apparatus","v":"1.534687","d":"double"},{"po":116048,"n":"tissue::urine","v":"2.40649","d":"double"},{"po":116048,"n":"compartment::nucleus","v":"5.0","d":"double"},{"po":116048,"n":"stringdb::structures","v":["1txp_A","1wf2_A","2mz1_A","AF-P07910"],"d":"list_of_string"},{"po":116048,"n":"tissue::saliva","v":"2.690853","d":"double"},{"po":116048,"n":"stringdb::species","v