e (ARAT) activity that catalyzes 11-cis- specific retinyl ester synthesis. Shows higher catalytic efficiency toward 11-cis-retinol versus 9-cis- retinol, 13-cis-retinol, and all-trans-retinol substrates."},{"po":115820,"n":"tissue::thyroid gland","v":"0.53813","d":"double"},{"po":115820,"n":"display name","v":"AWAT2"},{"po":115820,"n":"stringdb::sequence","v":""},{"po":115820,"n":"tissue::intestine","v":"1.146119","d":"double"},{"po":115820,"n":"stringdb::database identifier","v":"9606.ENSP00000421172"},{"po":115820,"n":"tissue::blood","v":"1.806966","d":"double"},{"po":115820,"n":"tissue::spleen","v":"1.470898","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"padj","v":"2.796086048351334E-6","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"stringdb::namespace","v":"stringdb"},{"po":115802,"n":"compartment::golgi apparatus","v":"4.31402","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"tissue::urine","v":"2.092061","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"compartment::nucleus","v":"3.844469","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"stringdb::structures","v":["1b4r_A","6a70_B","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161","AF-P98161"],"d":"list_of_string"},{"po":115802,"n":"tissue::saliva","v":"1.667845","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"stringdb::species","v":"Homo sapiens"},{"po":115802,"n":"compartment::peroxisome","v":"0.98451","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"tissue::liver","v":"3.017197","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"lfcSE","v":"0.1629552838149896","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"compartment::extracellular","v":"5.0","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"tissue::stomach","v":"2.104513","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"tissue::bone marrow","v":"1.865929","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"compartment::endosome","v":"1.625708","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"tissue::heart","v":"3.055753","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"compartment::lysosome","v":"1.622618","d":"double"},{"po":115802,"n":"stringdb::enhancedLabe